{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e5f4d66-937a-8a2a-a28e-676328334f22",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T15:43:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy Friday after Christmas. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. My name is Maureen Donovan. I am calling about the February vacation week camp. Do you have one this year?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do usually run a vacation week program in February. Let me pull up what we have. Sorry, bear with me one sec."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, thank you. I am sorry, I am in the car, speakerphone. The engine is a little loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Sorry, I am merging now, it will roar when I go faster. [inaudible] Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I got you. The engine's a little rumbly but you're coming through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. Thank you. So the camp is February vacation week, yes? The week the schools are closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the one. Registration for it typically opens a few weeks ahead, and the details get posted on the city website and at the center."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so registration, a few weeks before, website and the center. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now what about the age limits? What ages can go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's for school-age kids, generally kindergarten through about middle school. I don't have the exact cutoff in front of me for this February, so I'd want to confirm that before you count on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So kindergarten up to middle school, but the exact age you will confirm. [line breaks up] Sorry, I accelerate again, the engine is loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. I can have the program coordinator call you back with the exact ages and dates. Want to leave a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one six one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-one. And that's Maureen Donovan, D-O-N-O-V-A-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Maureen Donovan. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Since it's the holiday week, it might be Monday or Tuesday before she gets back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday or Tuesday, okay. That is no problem. So the coordinator calls me about age limits and the dates for February week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:43:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Thank you for your help. Happy new year to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Maureen. Drive safe, bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye, thank you."
    }
  ],
